{# Deterministic fallback copy, rendered server-side when the model cannot be
   used or returned something we refuse to trust. The user always gets a
   sensible next step even with the AI completely unavailable. #}
{% if reason == "ai_unavailable" -%}
AI booking is temporarily unavailable, so I can't take this by chat right now.
You can still book in a few seconds using the manual form.
{% elif reason == "invalid_output" -%}
Sorry — I didn't quite follow that. Could you rephrase it, or switch to the
manual form if that's quicker?
{% elif reason == "too_many_attempts" -%}
I'm still not sure I've understood what you need. The manual form will get this
booked in a few seconds.
{% else -%}
{% if missing_fields -%}
I still need {{ missing_fields | join(" and ") }} before I can book this.
{% else -%}
Could you give me a little more detail about the appointment you'd like?
{% endif -%}
{% endif -%}
